{"title":"2020 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 4a","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_4\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2020 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_4a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> have no common divisor larger than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. If the difference between b and a is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/8/9584e7508973e719087ed6c32b4fe56b2b7c1a1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac59&lt;\\frac{a}b&lt;\\frac47$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"90\" height=\"38\" />, what is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/4/084079bf1d54500f3c59257a7ec3467932b72ba2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a}{b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"34\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_4a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Because both <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/c/e7cee4c1bc083c3979f7ac19ac9f8646a3d0a29e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5}{9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"11\" height=\"37\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/d/fbdf54bb2e83a91aeaa4050a8fbdf9847927eeef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac47$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"11\" height=\"37\" /> are less than one, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/0/710e3e4f18d7c0270ab719a00adc61fa12363b1e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a&lt;b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" />. Because the difference between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> is 15, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/6/6a6a71fe875713aeac9966e202f5dacd27bac50a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=b-15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />, so we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/2/ea2178586798e87e92d8558e23df0f4fd2dee4c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac59&lt;\\frac{b-15}b&lt;\\frac47$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"129\" height=\"39\" />. Using the left side of the equation, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/b/fab698fb803e8eece497bad768aaefc237df31d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac59&lt;\\frac{b-15}b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"91\" height=\"39\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/1/1c1135c755a43c0a38f0126aed1d125790ef7bda.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5b&lt;9b-135$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"109\" height=\"16\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/2/4421f9e4243894c05e351f2dfbc7ef14103a5d19.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$135&lt;4b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"70\" height=\"15\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/8/7887738b069bfd63aa937d24fda0ced004ef7abf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b&gt;\\frac{135}4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"65\" height=\"38\" />. Using the right side of the equation, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/6/1c6e18df56823df45c1b67e8f927eb101d7b8395.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{b-15}b&lt;\\frac47$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"91\" height=\"39\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/0/bf01f9321095bef6f2afa201a6105a715410f630.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7b-105&lt;4b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"109\" height=\"16\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/a/1ca581a50e35e22225591a3e6e8d43be3ca3b924.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3b&lt;105$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"70\" height=\"15\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/9/b39b277ef46374a012e774ae30855936a456454c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b&lt;35$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"52\" height=\"15\" />. Combining both inequalities will give us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/e/93e4be0c9751abe0bec1a7ea0ebc9afe1ae04e43.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$35&gt;b&gt;\\frac{135}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"108\" height=\"38\" />, so the only possible integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> that satisfies this inequality is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/0/b7047aef8012ac1246d0d6a8d01e34ffdcef33ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=34$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"14\" />. Therefore, our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/f/0bf68cfb8589c373cdcb7658bbd197ddcdc9271e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\frac{19}{34}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"35\" height=\"49\" />.\n</p><p>~original by Yuhao2012\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018012644\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.015 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.029 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 97/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4538/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.906      1 2020_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_4\n100.00%    5.906      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:35898:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018012644 and revision id 279178. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}